cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FKS Sanger Pipeline"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alsanea
    given-names: Madain
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/fks-sanger-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Automated detection of FKS1 and FKS2 hotspot mutations from paired Sanger
  sequencing chromatograms in Nakaseomyces glabratus. Performs quality
  trimming, forward/reverse consensus assembly, translation, and variant
  calling with explicit quality gates. Reports mutations only; no clinical
  interpretation is applied.
keywords:
  - Sanger sequencing
  - Nakaseomyces glabratus
  - Candida glabrata
  - FKS1
  - FKS2
  - bioinformatics
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-19"
